{"id":"trend-line","label":"Scatter with Trend Line","description":"Point cloud with a fitted straight line and its equation, drawn as a markLine between two coordinates.","howTo":["Bind `series[0].data` to rows `[x, y]`.","ECharts does not fit the line in a JSON option: compute slope and intercept yourself (script transform or query) and bind the two end points `series[0].markLine.data[0][0].coord` and `[0][1].coord` as `[x, y]`.","The equation text is `markLine.data[0][0].name`, shown by the label `formatter` (`{b}`); bind it to a formatted string.","For a plain average line use `markLine.data: [{\"type\": \"average\", \"valueDim\": \"y\"}]` instead; that one ECharts calculates itself."],"props":{"option":{"tooltip":{"formatter":"{c}"},"grid":{"left":54,"right":120,"top":30,"bottom":46},"xAxis":{"name":"Load (%)","nameLocation":"middle","nameGap":28,"min":0,"max":110},"yAxis":{"name":"Motor current (A)","scale":true},"series":[{"name":"Samples","type":"scatter","symbolSize":8,"data":[[99,23.3],[97,22.9],[36,13.7],[25,10.9],[94,21.7],[82,22.5],[60,14.3],[47,14.5],[32,12.6],[45,14.3],[72,21.1],[55,16.8],[88,20.3],[90,21],[38,9.6],[25,10.6],[100,24.6],[99,24.3],[69,16.8],[38,9.9],[49,11.9],[27,11.9],[46,15.8],[99,22.8],[34,11.7],[31,11.1],[50,16.2],[31,8.1],[56,13.3],[46,13.4],[40,11.1],[34,11.1],[68,16.7],[57,13.8],[36,9.2],[40,10.6],[85,20.9],[93,24.4],[54,14.5],[77,19.7],[32,12.4],[32,8.6],[65,19.4],[22,7.9],[23,7]],"itemStyle":{"opacity":0.8},"markLine":{"symbol":"none","animation":false,"lineStyle":{"type":"solid","width":2,"color":"#e5484d"},"label":{"formatter":"{b}","position":"end","color":"#e5484d","fontSize":12},"tooltip":{"formatter":"{b}"},"data":[[{"name":"y = 0.20x + 4.4","coord":[15,7.3]},{"coord":[105,24.9]}]]}}]}}},
